WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.773
Let's do a few together.

00:00:01.823 --> 00:00:03.201
Problem 1.

00:00:03.251 --> 00:00:08.193
A floor covers 76 square feet, and it is 4 feet wide.

00:00:08.243 --> 00:00:09.540
How long is it?

00:00:09.590 --> 00:00:13.522
The area is in square feet, and the side is in feet.

00:00:13.572 --> 00:00:14.811
They match.

00:00:14.861 --> 00:00:17.574
So, 4 times what makes 76?

00:00:17.624 --> 00:00:19.536
I'll build rows of 4.

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:23.495
Row after row, until all 76 tiles are used.

00:00:23.545 --> 00:00:25.422
Now count the rows.

00:00:25.472 --> 00:00:26.885
19 rows.

00:00:26.935 --> 00:00:30.078
76 divided by 4 is 19.

00:00:30.128 --> 00:00:33.572
Check: 19 times 4 is 76.

00:00:33.622 --> 00:00:35.882
The floor is 19 feet long.

00:00:35.932 --> 00:00:37.125
Problem 2.

00:00:37.175 --> 00:00:38.622
Your turn first.

00:00:38.672 --> 00:00:40.758
Pause the video and try this one.

00:00:40.808 --> 00:00:42.941
Then press play and check.

00:00:42.991 --> 00:00:48.549
The area is 84 square inches, and one side is one half of a foot.

00:00:48.599 --> 00:00:50.441
The units don't match.

00:00:50.491 --> 00:00:53.449
Half of 12 inches is 6 inches.

00:00:53.499 --> 00:00:56.258
So, 6 times what makes 84?

00:00:56.308 --> 00:00:59.683
84 divided by 6 is 14.

00:00:59.733 --> 00:01:03.770
Check: 14 times 6 is 84.

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.231
The side is 14 inches.

00:01:06.281 --> 00:01:07.799
Problem 3.

00:01:07.849 --> 00:01:09.563
Watch out for this one.

00:01:09.613 --> 00:01:14.811
A rectangle covers 48 square inches, and one side is 1 foot.

00:01:14.861 --> 00:01:20.407
Someone wrote 48 divided by 1 is 48 inches.

00:01:20.457 --> 00:01:23.008
But the units don't match.

00:01:23.058 --> 00:01:25.725
1 foot is 12 inches.

00:01:25.775 --> 00:01:29.602
48 divided by 12 is 4.

00:01:29.652 --> 00:01:32.528
The side is 4 inches.

00:01:32.578 --> 00:01:35.110
Same units first, then divide.
